# Project Requirements

Build a chore tracking web app for households.

## Core features

- Users sign up with email and password
- Each user belongs to one household
- Household has an invite code for joining
- Partners can create chores (name, category, difficulty: easy/medium/hard)
- Chores rotate among partners fairly
- Dashboard shows today's chores, upcoming, and overdue
- Completing a chore awards points based on difficulty
- Fairness stats show points per partner

## Tech stack

Django 5.0, PostgreSQL, Bootstrap 5, pytest

## Non-goals (out of scope for v1)

- Mobile app
- Email notifications
- Social login